{"results":[{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/sunteck-realty/sunteck-signia-high-8821","title":"Sunteck Signia High, Borivali East, Mumbai | 2 & 3 BHK Luxury Apartments | Houssed","raw_content":"[![Houssed](/assets/images/houssed_logo.svg)](/)\n\n[![whatsapp](/assets/images/whatsapp.svg)Connect Now](https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=918169114718&text=Hi%2C+I%27m+looking+to+Buy+a+residential+property+in+Mumbai.+Please+connect+with+me.+Thanks%21&type=phone_number&app_absent=0)\n\n![Project Image of Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 81008](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/Project%20Image/3a56f8b78f16c9386f3ba7518cdb0f0a.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Project Image of Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 81007](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/Project%20Image/434058708bb90bd4b40ade305d206ff3.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 81009](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/Amenities/23bca8af62cf8c9aa38a316899dfeb4e.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Amenities of Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 81010](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/Amenities/537af5522a150831aded18812eed3e65.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Sample Apartment of Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 81011](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/Sample%20Apartment/b5bfddac6c72c144ba486aa205e36677.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Sample Apartment of Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 81012](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/Sample%20Apartment/4a86ff8836f024d142d114535d3a4776.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Sample Apartment of Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 81013](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/Sample%20Apartment/da81a3da2df440faa56a761702a93b0d.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n![Location of Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 81014](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/Location/071c1f66dcfb871e8a6cf974641c2d58.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Luxury\n\n## Project Overview of Sunteck Signia High Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nNo. of Units\n\n109 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n2 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 30 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nWelcome to Signia High, where luxury living reaches new heights. Signia High offers exquisite 1RK, 2, 3, 3.5 and 4 BHK residences that redefine opulence. Nestled in the heart of luxury, Signia High combines world-class amenities with spacious, beautiful homes, ensuring an unparalleled living experience.  \n  \nEach residence is meticulously crafted, boasting grand living spaces and breathtaking views from sun decks, providing residents with a taste of heaven. The clubhouse is a hub of indoor recreation, offering limitless opportunities for leisure and entertainment. Whether you seek relaxation or excitement, Signia High caters to your every need.  \n  \nEmbrace the epitome of luxury living, where every detail is designed to exceed your expectations. At Signia High, you'll revel in the lavishness of king-sized living, where every moment is a celebration of indulgence and sophistication. Experience the pinnacle of luxury living at Signia High, where you'll find the perfect balance of opulence and comfort.\n\n## Floor Plans & Pricing of Sunteck Signia High Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 626294](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/BHK_Configuration/6bd031d870db98fd9e334e2dfc700e84.webp)\n\n2 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1020 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n4.46 Cr\n\n![3 BHK Flat in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 626295](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/BHK_Configuration/5ea475c8e2bbbb869cc4527f2af3f18d.webp)\n\n3 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1473 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n6.45 Cr\n\n![4 BHK Flat in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 626297](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/BHK_Configuration/fc04ca8d5077a129309d9f75dbd276db.webp)\n\n4 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1821 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n7.99 Cr\n\n![5 BHK Flat in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai - Image 626296](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/8821/BHK_Configuration/5430d5dc356b8d5a95f042d63035f5c1.webp)\n\n5 BHK Flat\n\nCarpet Area\n\n1600 Sq Ft\n\nPrice\n\n7 Cr\n\n## Key Features of Sunteck Signia High Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* Majestic Views.\n* King-Sized Residences.\n* Opulent Interiors.\n* World-Class Amenities.\n* Prime Location.\n* Superior Lifestyle.\n\n## Amenities Sunteck Signia High Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n* 24X7 Water Supply\n* Intercom Facility\n* Power Back Up\n* Solar Power\n* Meditation Zone\n* Children Playing Zone\n* Senior Citizen Sitting Area\n* Senior Citizens' Walking Track\n* Parking and transportation\n* Clubhouse\n* Multipurpose Hall\n* Society Office\n* Convenience Store\n\n* Reserved Parking\n* Cctv Surveillance\n* Entrance Gate With Security\n* Fire Fighting System\n* Earthquake-resistant\n* 24/7 Security\n\n* Gymnasium\n* Kids Play Area\n* Indoor Games\n* Jogging Track\n* Cycle Track\n\n* Community Club\n* Recreation/Kids Club\n* Pool Deck With Sun\n* Swimming Pool\n* Indoor Kids' Play Area\n* Indoor Games And Activities\n* Vastu-compliant designs\n* Nature Walkway\n\n* Mo Sewage Treatment Plant\n* Eco Life\n* Drip Irrigation System\n* Rainwater Harvesting\n\n* Marble flooring\n* Modular kitchen\n* Premium sanitary and CP fittings\n* Vitrified tile flooring\n* Stainless steel sink\n* Anti-skid Ceramic Tiles\n* Concealed Electrification\n* Concealed Plumbing\n* Multi-stranded cables\n* Laminated Flush Doors\n\n## Google Map Location of Sunteck Signia High Borivali East\n\n## Locality Overview of Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n