k and the values attached to them, such as teamwork, customer-centricity, honesty, and integrity.  \n  \nSunteck world, Sunteck City, Signia, and Signature Island stand on the vision of creating masterpieces, transcending the old standards.Investing in the most buzzing city and still getting under-luxury spaces with a stamp of the brand is a dream come true.  \n  \n  \n[Properties in Nagpur by Sunteck Realty](https://houssed.com/nagpur/sale/builder/sunteck-realty-259), [Properties in Thane by Sunteck Realty](https://houssed.com/thane/sale/builder/sunteck-realty-259), [Properties in Palghar by Sunteck Realty](https://houssed.com/palghar/sale/builder/sunteck-realty-259), [Properties in Navi Mumbai by Sunteck Realty](https://houssed.com/navi.mumbai/sale/builder/sunteck-realty-259), [Properties in Mumbai by Sunteck Realty](https://houssed.com/mumbai/sale/builder/sunteck-realty-259)\n\n## FAQ's about Sunteck Signia High Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n---\n\n## Resale flats in Sunteck Signia High\n\n [View all 2 properties](/buy/residential/resale/mumbai/sunteck-signia-high-8821)\n\n## Popular Real Estate Searches\n\n### Browse Homes in Borivali East\n\n* [Affordable Homes in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/segment/affordable)\n* [Luxury Homes in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/segment/luxury)\n* [Premium Homes in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/segment/premium)\n\n### Discover Homes in Borivali East\n\n* [Apartments in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/property/flat)\n* [Duplex in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/property/duplex)\n* [Studio Apartment in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/property/studio-apartment)\n\n### Explore Projects in Borivali East\n\n* [New Projects in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/possession/new-projects)\n* [Pre Launch Projects in Borivali East](/mumbai-borivali.east/sale/flats/possession/pre-launch)\n* [Ready To Move Projects in Borivali East](