)\n\n# Sunteck Signia High Borivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Sunteck Signia High Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sunteck-signia-high-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Sunteck Signia High Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sunteck-signia-high-project-amenities-features1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Sunteck Signia High Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/sunteck-signia-high-project-amenities-features2.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Sunteck Signia High Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-sunteck-signia-high-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹4.00 Cr - 5.12 Cr**\n\n₹23,158 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Sunteck Signia High?\n\n## About Sunteck Signia High, Borivali East by Sunteck\n\nSunteck Signia High, located in the heart of Borivali East, is a premium residential project designed for those who crave luxury and comfort. Strategically situated near Swami Vivekanand Road, Dattapada Road, Western Express Highway, and Link Road, this project offers convenient connectivity to major hospitals, schools, markets, and other essential amenities.\n\nThis project offers a range of 3 and 4 BHK apartments with world-class specifications, including vitrified tiles for the master bedroom floor. With amenities like power backup and a fully equipped gymnasium, you can indulge in a healthy and hassle-free lifestyle. The project s Rera registration number is P51800007984, ensuring that your investment is safe and secure.\n\nExperience the epitome of luxury living at Sunteck Signia High, where every moment is filled with comfort, style, and sophistication. With its unbeatable location, premium amenities, and exceptional specifications, this project is the perfect choice for those seeking a luxurious lifestyle in Borivali East.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Sunteck Signia High:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 2735 | 4.31 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 2542 | 4.00 Cr |\n| 4 BHK Apartment | 3251 | 5.12 Cr |\n\nThe residential property is strategically located near several notable landmarks, providing residents with easy access to essential amenities and services. These landmarks not only enhance the quality of life for residents but also offer a unique blend of convenience and comfort.\n\nWe have total 6 options available in Sunteck Signia High for resale and rental, In resale we have 3 properties available ranging from 3 BHK - 5 BHK having sizes from 6.50 CR - 10.00 CR\n\nFor rent you can check 3 properties having options for 3.5 BHK with price ranging from 1.45 L.\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Listing Type | Total Listings | Unit Type Range | Price Range |\n Rental | 3 | 3.5 BHK | 1.45 L || Resale | 3 | 3 BHK - 5 BHK | 6.50 CR - 10.00 CR |\n\nThe real estate market has witnessed a consistent trend in the rental rates over the past few months. As per the government-registered transactions, the rental rate has remained steady at 59.667 for an aggregation period of both three-months and six-months, with the current rate sitting at 21,904. Similarly, a one-year aggregation period has also resulted in a rental rate of 59.667, with the current rate again being 21,904. These statistics indicate a stable and thriving real estate market with minimal fluctuations in rental rates.\n\n## Sunteck Signia High Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Sunteck Signia High.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  2542 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 4.00 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  2735 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 4.31 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  3251 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 5.12 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nSunteck Signia High's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali East.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Sunteck Signia High | Borivali East |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 37450 | 35650 |\n| Mar 2026 | 37150 | 34750 |\n| Dec 2025 | 47300 | 32450 |\n| Sep 2025 | 41500 | 30650 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali East ranges from ₹ 19.1 K to ₹ 1.5 L with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Sunteck Signia High | In Borivali East |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 31.8 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 46.2 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 98.6 K |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 1.5 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Sunteck Signia High.\n\n#### MMRDA Plans Two New Ring Roads to Ease Mumbai Traffic\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) is planning two additional ring routes, expanding its proposed network from seven to nine. These new corridors will cover approximately 307 km and will connect existing roads and planned projects across Mumbai, Thane, and Navi Mumbai.\n\n#### Thane Infrastructure and Development Updates\n\nThe Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel project saw the launch of TBM Arjuna on August 13, 2026, aiming to reduce travel time between Thane and Borivali to approximately 15 minutes. Amazon Data Services is developing a large data center in Ambernath, with an estimated construction cost of ₹3,500 crore, to be ready by 2029\n\n#### Mumbai Boosts Connectivity with Santacruz - Chembur link road Phase 2 & Chembur Metro Station\n\nCM Devendra Fadnavis inaugurated Phase 2 of the Santacruz-Chembur Link Road (SCLR) & the Chembur Metro Station under Metro Line 2B,The SCLR Phase 2 is expected to strengthen the road network between Mumbai's western and eastern suburbs, improving east-west connectivity.\n\n#### Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel Project: Traffic Diversions Announced in Kasarvadavali\n\nTemporary traffic diversions have been implemented in Kasarvadavali for the ongoing work on the ambitious Thane-Borivali twin tunnel project by the Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA). Certain routes will be closed from July 6 to August 5, 2026, to facilitate construction.\n\n#### Mumbai Monorail Services to Resume After Nine-Month Hiatus\n\nMumbai's monorail services are set to resume soon after a nine-month suspension, following approval from the Maharashtra government for safety improvements and fare revisions. MMRDA has proposed increased ticket prices. The monorail, which previously carried around 18,000 passengers daily, will offer improved services after safety upgrades.\n\nRent in Sunteck Signia High ranges from ₹ 13 K to ₹ 2 L with options available for 1 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Sunteck Signia High moved from ₹ 37,150/sqft to ₹ 37,450/sqft, reflecting a 0.81% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n## Sunteck Signia High Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 2735 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sunteck Signia High, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/sunteck-signia-high-apartment-3bhk-2713sqft1.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 4.31 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 2542 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sunteck Signia High, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/sunteck-signia-high-apartment-3bhk-2521sqft1.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 4.00 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 4 BHK 3251 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Sunteck Signia High, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/sunteck-signia-high-apartment-4bhk-3224sqft1.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 5.12 Cr\n\n## Resale Listings in Sunteck Signia High\n\nExplore resale listings currently available in Sunteck Signia High, Mumbai.\n\n![3 BHK + Prayer Room Apartment For Sale in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK + Servant Room Apartment For Sale in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK Apartment For Sale in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![3 BHK + Prayer Room Apartment For Sale in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![3.5 BHK + Prayer Room Apartment For Sale in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK Apartment For Sale in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![4 BHK + Pooja Room,Servant Room,Study Room,Extra Room,Basement,Store Room Apartment For Sale in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali East, Mumbai]()\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shivam Kumar  profile picture]()\n![4 BHK + Pooja Room,Servant Room,Study Room,Extra Room,Basement,Store Room Apartment For Sale in Sunteck Signia High in Borivali 