ct in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mayfair-shyam-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.60 Cr to 2.27 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Regency residential project in Dahisar West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rustomjee-regency-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nDahisar West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 70.85 Lac to 1.09 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Royale residential project in Dahisar East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rustomjee-royale-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nDahisar East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 76.47 Lac to 1.30 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Regal residential project in Dahisar West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rustomjee-regal-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nDahisar West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 85.50 Lac to 1.23 Cr\n\n![Rustomjee Complex residential project in Dahisar West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rustomjee-complex-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nDahisar West, Mumbai\n\n1, 5 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Rustomjee Residency residential project in Dahisar West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rustomjee-residency-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nDahisar West, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 72.67 Lac\n\n![Mayfair Housing Shyam residential project in Kandivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/mayfair-housing-shyam-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.76 Cr to 2.53 Cr\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Sunteck Signia High\n\n### What are the key features of the project that make it an ideal living option?\n\nThe project, Sunteck Signia High, offers luxurious amenities like gymnasium, power backup, and 24x7 security, making it an ideal living option.\n\n### What is the configuration range available in this project, and what are the corresponding prices?\n\nThe available configurations are 3 BHK Apartments (Area: 2542-2735 Sq. Ft., Price: 4.00-4.31 Cr) and 4 BHK Apartments (Area: 3251 Sq. Ft., Price: 5.12 Cr) with varying prices depending on the size and amenities.\n\n### Are the units in this project part of a gated community, and what kind of security features are available?\n\nYes, the units in Sunteck Signia High are part of a gated community, with 24x7 security as one of the key amenities ensuring a safe and secure living environment.\n\n### What is the status of construction in this project, and what is the expected possession date?\n\nThe project - Sunteck Signia High - is a Ready to Move property, meaning the construction is complete, and the possession date is expected to be met.\n\n### Who is the developer behind this project, and what is their reputation in the real estate market?\n\nThe developer behind Sunteck Signia High is Sunteck, a well-established developer with a reputation for delivering quality projects and a proven track record of 34 successful projects.\n\n### What kind of amenities and specifications can I expect in the units of this project?\n\nThe units of Sunteck Signia High come with premium specifications, including vitrified tiles flooring, fully equipped modular kitchen, and premium bath fittings, ensuring a luxurious living experience.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/project/signia-high-borivali-east/4773","